<title>USA: TENNIS-U.S. BEATS NETHERLANDS 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-U.S. BEATS NETHERLANDS 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, California 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United</p>
<p>States beat the Netherlands 4-1 in their Davis Cup</p>
<p>quarter-final tie after winning both reverse singles matches</p>
<p>Sunday:</p>
<p>Andre Agassi (U.S.) beat Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) 3-6 3-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Jonathan Stark (U.S.) beat Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) 6-4</p>
<p>6-0</p>
</text>
